&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ go run channels.go
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">ping
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>Think of goroutines as the &amp;ldquo;workers&amp;rdquo; and channels as the &amp;ldquo;communication lines&amp;rdquo; that allow these workers to coordinate and exchange information effectively.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>